#!/bin/sh
set -eu
umask 077
cd "$(dirname -- "$0")/.."
mkdir -p var/ci
scripts/setup
if ! scripts/validate > var/ci/tests.txt 2>&1; then
    cat var/ci/tests.txt >&2
    exit 1
fi
cat var/ci/tests.txt
scripts/demo
scripts/evaluate --output var/ci/evaluation.json > var/ci/summary.json
python3 - <<'PY'
import json
from pathlib import Path
expected, actual = (json.loads(Path(p).read_text()) for p in
                    ["reports/evaluation.json", "var/ci/evaluation.json"])
for field in ("python", "sqlite"):
    expected.pop(field)
    actual.pop(field)
if expected != actual:
    raise SystemExit("Evaluation differs from retained evidence")
print("Reproduced the retained tuning and holdout evidence.")
PY
